      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLOPPA (3) led and stuck on when fourth at Wagga last start having recorded a win and a close second in the other two outings this time in. Has the speed to be prominent from this draw and will be at peak fitness now. MAURLEN COMPASS (9) came from wider on this row and finished runner-up in a Vicbred consolation in her her most recent outing at Melton, beaten 1.4 metres. Has won here before and with even luck has the talent to take care of this field. IM DUSTEE (6) draws a couple of spots lower than in his resuming fourth here and should strip fitter. LEONARD (8) cannot be left out after solid recent performances including a Swan Hill win two back.",
